OL,3,AJason Arday research cleared following
OL,4,AQueen's University investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch by academic Jason Arday, who
OL,7,Fwas accused of plagiarism before his
OL,8,Fdeath, has been cleared by one of the
OL,9,Finstitutions that was investigating
OL,10,Fhim.
OL,12,FQueen's University Belfast (QUB) began
OL,13,Flooking into Jason Arday's work after
OL,14,Fhe resigned from his University of
OL,15,FCambridge roles.
OL,17,FThe university had published a paper on
OL,18,Fits academic research site co-authored
OL,19,Fby Arday and other academics from
OL,20,FQueen's in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
