OL,3,AJason Arday research cleared following
OL,4,AQueen's University investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for QUB
OL,7,Fsaid: "Having reviewed the matter, we
OL,8,Fare satisfied that the paper meets the
OL,9,Fappropriate academic standards and have
OL,10,Fno concerns regarding its publication."
